# Adapted from ntc-templates (Apache-2.0); see NOTICE.md.
Value interface (\S+)
Value ip_address (\S+)
Value interface_status (up|down|administratively down|deleted)
Value protocol_status (up|down)
Value address_family (\S+)

Start
  ^${interface}\s+${ip_address}\s+\w+\s+\w+\s+${interface_status}\s+${protocol_status} -> Record
  # Capture time-stamp if vty line has command time-stamping turned on
  ^Load\s+for\s+
  ^Time\s+source\s+is
